WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
Welcome to the quarterly product review.

00:02.400 --> 00:06.000
Today we look at what shipped, what is next,
and your questions.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.200
The next release focuses on faster start up,

00:18.200 --> 00:21.800
better offline support,
and a new reporting module.

00:30.000 --> 00:33.600
In the demo we open a customer record,
change the address,

00:33.600 --> 00:36.400
and every user sees the update at once.

00:45.000 --> 00:47.200
Finally, questions and answers.

00:47.200 --> 00:50.800
Thank you for joining,
and see you at the next review.
